/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
| Cluster Channel                                                     | 0x0504 |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Commands:                                                           |        |
| * ChangeChannel                                                     |   0x00 |
| * ChangeChannelByNumber                                             |   0x02 |
| * SkipChannel                                                       |   0x03 |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Attributes:                                                         |        |
| * ChannelList                                                       | 0x0000 |
| * Lineup                                                            | 0x0001 |
| * CurrentChannel                                                    | 0x0002 |
| * GeneratedCommandList                                              | 0xFFF8 |
| * AcceptedCommandList                                               | 0xFFF9 |
| * AttributeList                                                     | 0xFFFB |
| * FeatureMap                                                        | 0xFFFC |
| * ClusterRevision                                                   | 0xFFFD |
|------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Events:                                                             |        |
\*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

